       ],
       "heading_1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "jcr:title": "Semiconductor-Grade Strain Sensing for Smarter Machines",
        "type": "h1",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
       },
       "text_1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "text": "<p>STREAL™ brings semiconductor-level precision to the factory floor with semiconductor strain gauges, capturing real-time force, load, and torque data in places traditional gauges cannot reach. Macnica Americas turns that signal into results with design services, firmware, and production support for STREAL industrial strain gauges.</p>",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
        "textIsRich": "true"
       }
      }
     }
    }
   },
   "section_2_wrap": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
    "cq:styleIds": [
     "1717498053499",
     "1717498052331"
    ],
    "heading_1": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "jcr:title": "Why STREAL?",
     "type": "h2",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
    },
    "text_1": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "text": "<ul>\r\n<li><b>Microscale precision</b>&nbsp;for motion control, machining quality, structural health, and micromobility. Not intended for automotive-grade or safety-critical automotive use.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Compact and easy to embed</b>&nbsp;on toolholders, robot joints, composite parts, and frames. Slim semiconductor strain gauge modules fit in tight envelopes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Low power options</b>&nbsp;that enable battery-powered wireless nodes and IIoT retrofits.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Integrated intelligence where you need it</b>&nbsp;with digital conversion, temperature compensation, and self-diagnostics on select models.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>A portfolio that fits the job</b>&nbsp;from power-optimized industrial strain gauges to high-resolution industrial parts.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<hr>",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
     "textIsRich": "true"
    }
   },
