       "text_1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "text": "<ul>\r\n<li><b>Resolution:</b> 0.1 µε measured at 1.3 kHz</li>\r\n<li><b>Signal bandwidth:</b> up to 20 kHz</li>\r\n<li><b>Typical power:</b> about 70 mW</li>\r\n<li><b>Die size:</b> 3.2 mm × 3.2 mm</li>\r\n<li><b>Integrated functions:</b> on-chip ADC and amplifier, temperature compensation, and self-diagnostics</li>\r\n</ul>",
