    "text_1": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "text": "<p>Schedule a design consultation or request evaluation hardware from Macnica Americas regarding industrial strain gauges for sale. Our team will help you select the right STREAL configuration, plan your data path, and move from prototype to production with confidence.</p>",
